  "content": {
    "text": "CONCLUDED\n2 days ago\nHere's what Apple has to do to convince skeptics of its AI prowess\nHas Apple turned a corner with its artificial-intelligence efforts? That depends on convincing \"the only skeptics that really matter,\" according to Forrester principal analyst Dipanjan Chatterjee.\nThat refers not to Wall Street investors, but rather to customers or prospective customers who are considering AI alternatives.\n\"Despite trailing the competitive space in AI implementation, Apple has not seen a negative effect on the installed base or on revenue growth,\" Chatterjee said in emailed comments. \"But that grace period has an expiry date. A second miss...could hasten that date significantly\"",
    "text_blocks": [
      "CONCLUDED",
      "2 days ago",
      "Here's what Apple has to do to convince skeptics of its AI prowess",
      "Has Apple turned a corner with its artificial-intelligence efforts? That depends on convincing \"the only skeptics that really matter,\" according to Forrester principal analyst Dipanjan Chatterjee.",
      "That refers not to Wall Street investors, but rather to customers or prospective customers who are considering AI alternatives.",
      "\"Despite trailing the competitive space in AI implementation, Apple has not seen a negative effect on the installed base or on revenue growth,\" Chatterjee said in emailed comments. \"But that grace period has an expiry date. A second miss...could hasten that date significantly\""
